 * thank you for your invaluable contribution to the Persian digital community.
 * Source: https://github.com/rastikerdar/vazirmatn
 *
 * normal / bold : Vazirmatn-Regular.ttf / Vazirmatn-Bold.ttf — unmodified static
 *     TTF files. They carry no glyph hinting (only a small prep program for
 *     dropout control), so they are not dehinted.
 * italic / bold italic : generated for PDF output from those two files by
 *     slanting the outlines 10° (oblique) with fontTools, because Vazirmatn
 *     has no italic. These are Modified Versions under the OFL.
