        /**
         * Plain Word HTML — for debugging. Images keep their original
         * sources (Word fetches web URLs when opening, nothing is embedded)
         * and the header/footer sit in the hidden table. Use toBlob() / save()
         * for the real .doc.
         * @returns {string}
         */
